# Files that `moon package` leaves out of the finos/morphir-elm archive on mooncakes. They are repository tooling,
# not the module: the TypeScript tooling and tests, the scripts and their Node packages, the pin of the data files,
# and the workspace file. See openspec/specs/elm-extension/release.
/tooling/
/tests/
/scripts/
/deps.toml
/moon.work
